	<p style="cursor:auto;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px!important; color:#666666; line-height:16px;">
		<b>Terms &amp; Conditions</b><br>
		<br>
		This ticket is non-refundable unless the original ticket was issued at a fully refundable fare. Some fares may not allow changes. If allowed, any change to your itinerary may require payment of a change fee and increased fare. Failure to appear for any flight without notice to Delta will result in cancellation of your remaining reservation.<br>
